 "note": "RPCS3 Core 920 = Core 919 plus two corrections for Call of Duty: Black Ops II. REWINDBOX_LEVER_COMPARISON_ON_REQUEST_920: Cores 917 to 919 switched Writer lock park spin and Busy wait reference duration off and on again between 5 s report windows in three passes during the first minutes of every boot whenever their settings were Automatic, the default (up to 36 windows with a lever off); the passes now run only with the diagnostic setting Lever comparison between report windows = Enabled, for a lever whose own setting is Automatic, bounded and logged; Automatic and Disabled never alternate and both levers stay as their settings resolve (Automatic: on). REWINDBOX_ZCULL_COST_920: COREPROF ZCULLCOST920 reports the age of the report each waiting ZCULL read waits for last and the RSX-thread time of the Core 919 watched submissions. Core 919 (pinned 44527c61): Black Ops II ZCULL watched flush with its own budget. No resolution, precision, frame limit, SPU count or priority or LLVM option changes. No codegen input changes: identities unchanged. Host bridge 8977315e unchanged; MoltenVK dependency of run 42733987255 (library d19d3a42). Built by the RPCS3 Core route (run 42838028676, attempt 1, source f0404065; Apple host harnesses run 42838028676 on f0404065). Verified offline on the downloaded artifacts with the repository verifier (pin_errors and bundle). Not measured on the iPhone; no FPS claim.",
